  "goodToKnow": "Wissentlich means knowingly or deliberately: wissentlich lügen, eine wissentliche Falschaussage. It's common in legal contexts, where wissentlich means acting with knowledge of the facts, close to vorsätzlich (intentionally). Unwissentlich means unknowingly. Don't confuse it with wissenschaftlich (scientific). From das Wissen (knowledge)."
